+| 1366×768 | 280 / 668 / 350 → 270 / 646 / 390 | 420 → 445.7 | 页脚继续完整落在视口内 | [HEAD](sol-evidence/head/1366x768-overview.png) · [候选](sol-evidence/candidate/1366x768-overview.png) |
